# layer_props.uis -- Ebeneneigenschaften (agent A4): the modal dialog window (F4, menu,
# layers window button), every blend mode through the combo box with a live preview checked
# by composite pixels (expected values: tools/blend_check.py ref_blend, paint.net
# UserBlendOps), opacity (slider number box), visibility, a name with umlauts, Abbrechen /
# Esc restore everything (and the modified flag), OK = ONE history step with the old values.
# Fixtures (tests/fixtures/layers/make_fixtures.py): l4_lo.png / l4_hi.png, 4 x 2 px:
#   lower (200,100,50,255) (30,180,220,255) (128,64,192,255) (90,90,90,200)
#   upper (60,150,240,200) (220,40,100,255) (100,200,30,128) (250,10,130,255)
# over the white background; composite pixels (0..3, 0) = cmd 900 0..3 -> #9900.
# Probes: diag.s A1 (#9903 layers, #9904 current, #9905 modified, #9906 name / visible,
# #9907 opacity, #9908 blend), layer.s A4 (#4391 history entry, #4392 entries, #4395
# open dialogs).  Dialog window 24608, name #5401, Sichtbar #5402, Mischmodus #5403,
# Deckfähigkeit #5404 (number box #1610699201).
size 1280 800
theme light
expect #9905 value 0
# ------------------------------------------------------------ an unchanged image: Abbrechen keeps it unmodified
key f4
expect window 24608 open
expect window 24608 modal
expect #4395 value 1
expect #5401 text "Hintergrund"
expect #5402 checked
expect #5404 value 255
click #1610699201
key ctrl+a
type "100"
key enter
expect #9907 value 100
expect #9905 value 1
click button:"Abbrechen"
expect window 24608 closed
expect #4395 value 0
expect #9907 value 255
expect #9905 value 0
expect #4392 value 1

# ------------------------------------------------------------ the two blend layers (import)
cmd 371 192
expect #9903 value 3
expect #9904 value 2
expect #9906 text "l4_hi.png"
expect #4391 text "Als Ebene importieren"
expect #4392 value 2
cmd 900 0
expect #9900 text "FF5A8BC7"
cmd 900 1
expect #9900 text "FFDC2864"
cmd 900 2
expect #9900 text "FF71846E"
cmd 900 3
expect #9900 text "FFFA0A82"

